 EVALUATION PROCEDURE OF COVARIANCE DATA ABOVE RESONANCE RANGE    7431 1451
                                                                  7431 1451
 The GANDR System is employed to generate covariance matrix of the7431 1451
 cross sections of W-182 based on the new INDL file produced as a 7431 1451
 result of an IAEA Data Development Project.                      7431 1451
                                                                  7431 1451
 The prior covariance matrix (above 100 keV) is generated by the  7431 1451
 Monte Carlo technique. The final covariance matrix is the result 7431 1451
 of a GANDR calculation after introducing a selected set of       7431 1451
 experimental data as follows. Only the EXFOR entries preceeded   7431 1451
 by the sequence number are included in the fitting procedure.    7431 1451
 Reasons for exclusion or modification are given in the comments. 7431 1451
